WEBVTT

00:54:29.482 --> 00:54:31.839
That was actually quite hopeful.

00:54:31.863 --> 00:54:35.760
KFL: Yes, if we look
at the US health care,

00:54:35.784 --> 00:54:39.614
the health care services sector
will grow in the next five years.

00:54:39.959 --> 00:54:44.045
That includes nurses, orderlies,

00:54:44.069 --> 00:54:49.529
at-home medical care
as well as elderly caretakers.

00:54:50.061 --> 00:54:53.331
So the total number of needs is there.

00:54:53.355 --> 00:54:57.776
And the people who might
lose their jobs in AI displacement

00:54:57.800 --> 00:54:59.283
from the routine jobs

00:54:59.307 --> 00:55:02.061
can be trained in these jobs.